    "result_text": "The build passes with all tests green.\n\n## Summary\n\nI implemented `membershipNumber` as a **derived field** (like the existing `displayName`/`initials`), since the spec/test note it's \"derived from the owner's own fields, so seed-independent.\"\n\nTwo changes:\n\n1. **`src/main/resources/openapi.yml`** \u2014 added a read-only `membershipNumber` property to the `Owner` schema, so the openapi-generator produces the field on `OwnerDto`.\n\n2. **`src/main/java/.../mapper/OwnerMapper.java`** \u2014 added a `@Mapping` on `toOwnerDto` that computes the value via a helper:\n   ```java\n   owner.getCustomerCode() + \"-M\" + String.format(\"%02d\", owner.getRegistrationDate().getYear() % 100)\n   ```\n   `%02d` on `year % 100` gives the zero-padded last two digits (e.g. `SMI-0007` + registration year 2026 \u2192 `SMI-0007-M26`). It returns `null` when `customerCode` or `registrationDate` is absent, so unmigrated seed owners (whose `INSERT` sets neither column) don't NPE when listed/fetched.\n\n`Tests run: 1, Failures: 0, Errors: 0` \u2014 `BUILD SUCCESS`.",
